<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Korea Electric Power.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Korea Electric Power.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it started coverage of Korea Electric Power Corp with a buy rating and an intermediate price target of $20.</p>
<p>-- Tne stock rose 1/4 to 18-3/4.</p>
